<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 51 0 R
/T (In today's fast-paced world, managing personal and professional tasks effectively has become essential. This project addresses that need by providing a lightweight, browser-based task management solution that requires no external backend or database, relying instead on the browser's localStorage for persistent data storage.)
/E (In today's fast-paced world, managing personal and professional tasks effectively has become essential. This project addresses that need by providing a lightweight, browser-based task management solution that requires no external backend or database, relying instead on the browser's localStorage for persistent data storage.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
